--------------------------------------------------------------------
Derived Model Weights Notice (Tencent Hy License, Version 1.0)
--------------------------------------------------------------------

The quantized and repacked expert weight artifacts derived from
`tencent/Hy4` (770B total / 49B active MoE) — specifically the lossless
stock FP8-g128 hot experts, WHT128-HLUT4 / WHT128-HLUT3 / WHT128-HLUT2
RAREBAL-LDLQ experts, and Q5_LM128 cold-tail experts — are Derivative
Works of `tencent/Hy4` and remain governed by the Tencent Hy License,
Version 1.0 (full text included in `meta/TENCENT_HY_LICENSE.txt`).

Section 4(b) Modification Notice:
These weight shards were modified from upstream `tencent/Hy4` by
bespoke ontology (the kitchen) with engineering collaboration from
Google DeepMind / Gemini (Gemini Carbon & Gemini Neon) via
frequency-sorted tiered repacking (FP8-g128 + WHT128-HLUT4 + Q5_LM128 /
WHT128-HLUT3 + WHT128-HLUT2) for single-workstation inference on
SB-M5-P2-192G.
